          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mosi wolweli chikasa chindi hewulu dakaluŋalwiji; chikwachili budidi kaluŋalwiji kafuntili cheŋi mwadiŋiyi muŋovu yindi; aEjipitu akatemukili; Yehova wayiluku mwini aEjipitu mukachi kakaluŋa lwŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meji afuntili cheŋi, nimakálu, ni akwakwendaha tuwalu, njita yaFwaro yejima yayilondeleli mukaluŋalwiji, meji ayibutiliwi-i; hikwasheli hoku muntu niwumuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa nyana kaIsarela kwawu endeli hamaseki awuma hakachi kakaluŋa lwŋi; meji ayimweni himbaŋu nihachikasa chawu chachidiilu nihachikasa chawu chachimunswa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
