          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AIsarela amweni Ŋovu yeneni yamwekesheliyi Yehova hadi aEjipitu; antu ana amutiyili Yehova woma, amwitiyili Yehova nakambu ŋindi Mosi.",
          "type": "text",
